>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero2" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero2-content-wrapper"><div class="hero2-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 70vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-35f1c4ef7a90f1.avif" width="1036"/><div class="hero2-image-overlay"></div></div><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Our Suites</div><h1 class="light">Our Suites: Serene Havens of Relaxation</h1></div></div></div><div class="section no-bottom-padding"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper inner-spacing div-block"><h2>Enjoy Laid-Back Luxury &amp; Vast Living Spaces</h2></div><div class="two-column-body-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid two-column-body-grid"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Our spacious suites are set across seven buildings amidst a sprawling Provençal garden for ultimate privacy and relaxation.<br/></p></div><div class="mobile-l-none"></div><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Contemporary clean lines meet soothing pink, earthy hues and hand-picked artworks, offering a luxurious feeling of well-being.<br/></p></div><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Each suite comes with a King Size Tréca bed with premium bedding and thoughtful mod-cons for a carefree stay, including a fully-stocked minibar.<br/><br/>They also feature a private outdoor space.<br/></p></div></div></div><div class="divider _96px mobile-none"></div><div class="room-type-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite Pétanque" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-833a78c568fe35.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Queen Size Suite - 2 people max -40 m2</p><h3>Suite Pétanque</h3><p class="paragraph-8">Suite Pétanque set within a beautifully renovated residence, offers more space than our smallest category, complete with a living area, a terrace with sun loungers, and a tranquil setting to unwind</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you love the perfect blend of timeless charm and modern style</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/suite-petanque.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite Pénard" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-eb795e7700a147.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Junior Suite - 2 people max - 30 m2</p><h3>Suite Pénard</h3><p class="paragraph-8">At 30 m2, this is our smallest suite, yet perfectly big enough. It comprises an airy sleeping area &amp; large French windows opening up to the private patio. In the bathroom, you’ll find a walk-in shower. </p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this suite if you want our most accessible option with garden views. Ideal for the artist in love.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/penard.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite de la Bronzette" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-8626fb58027da5.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">King size suite - 2 people max - 55 m2</p><h3>Suite de la Bronzette</h3><p class="paragraph-8">Spacious suites with bedroom and living room, allowing for extra privacy and the possibility to add an extra bed. You’ll find a sumptuous spa-like bathroom here, along with a large, private outdoor area with sunbeds.</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want even bigger indoors, and the option to sleep an extra person. Photographers love the light here.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/bronzette.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" class="w-dyn-bind-empty" loading="lazy" src="data:text/html; charset=utf-8;base64,"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Bath tub</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite de l'Artiste" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-e1708f1e9761a9.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Provencal Farmhouse Suite - 2 people max 60-70m2</p><h3>Suite de l'Artiste</h3><p class="paragraph-8">This modern rustic suite is situated in the 200-year-old farmhouse, where authentic details (think wooden beams and natural stone) have been preserved to complement the contemporary design. But, the picturesque balcony with views of the surroundings is what makes this suite so special.</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want an authentic experience in a converted farmhouse with garden views. The interior designer’s favourite.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/suiteaartiste.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-8064d9302a1c4a.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Old farmhouse</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite Cabanat" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-826f21859fa23e.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Deluxe King Suite with outdoor shower and sun cabanat - 2 people max - 55m2</p><h3>Suite Cabanat</h3><p class="paragraph-8">Our generous Suite Cabanat is a split-level affair (due to its position on a slope) with the sumptuous bedroom on the 1st floor opening up to a terrace with an outdoor shower. It features both a walk-in shower and a bath. The living room level boats a private garden with a sunbed cabana. </p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want lots of outdoor space to bask in the Mediterranean sun. The original room layout is adored by architects.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/suite-cabanat.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 32px, (max-width: 1279px) 3vw, (max-width: 1439px) 32px, (max-width: 1919px) 2vw, 32px" src="/assets/images/page-img-ae27418e5ad647.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor Shower</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-e6bebc1b9218e6.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Valley View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-f0a9933b3d627f.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Sun bed Cabana</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Mas de l'Artiste" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-6106adc613aeb2.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Family Suite 2 + 2 people max - 90 m2</p><h3>Mas de l'Artiste</h3><p class="paragraph-8">This vast sun-flooded maisonette is housed in the 200-year-old restored farmhouse. The sleeping area is neatly separated to ensure complete intimacy, whereas the living area gives direct access to a private Provençal courtyard with sun loungers and a very cosy sitting corner.</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want the biggest indoor space and the possibility to sleep up to 4 (2 adults and 2 children or 3 adults) in an old farmhouse. Loved by writers and poets.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/masartiste.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-73300bb374405d.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Outdoor area</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-8064d9302a1c4a.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Old farmhouse</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-3874f118411b98.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Extra Bed (+€80/n)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Suite du Bon-Vivant" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-707417a43d47ee.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Luxury holiday Suite with Pool - 2 people max - 55- 60 m2</p><h3>Suite du Bon-Vivant</h3><p class="paragraph-8">Our bright Suites du Bon-Vivant come with ample bedroom and lounging space, along with a luxury bathroom. The main attraction, however, is the exceptional terrace with a private pool. Here, the sunset is just magical.</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want a private pool and a gorgeous terrace to soak up the sun. The bon-vivant art collector's dream suite.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/bonvivant.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-775a29094f4579.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Private Pool</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-3874f118411b98.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Extra Bed (+€80/n)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="room-type-wrapper w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-type-image-wrapper large-height right-padding" data-w-id="00dadd01-fbed-4886-8687-8a733add35f2"><img alt="Villa du Pénéquet" class="room-type-image" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-5f8a45f5b552ed.jpg"/></div><div class="room-type-content-wrapper right-padding"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">2-floor Pool Villa - 2 people max - 80m2 (extra bed possible with surcharge)</p><h3>Villa du Pénéquet</h3><p class="paragraph-8">The Villas du Pénéquet–the Provençal word for power-nap–are the only suites boasting two floors. Downstairs houses the luxurious living area with direct access to your own private pool and sun loungers. On the first floor, we find the master bedroom and a bathroom with a large bathtub and separate walk-in shower.</p><p class="toom-type-choose">Choose this one if you want the biggest suite on 2 floors and a private pool, with the possibility to add an extra bed. For the art patron.</p><div class="room-type-btn-wrapper"><a class="button secondary w-button" href="suites/penequet.html">View More</a></div></div><div class="room-amenity-section"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="room-collection-list w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-775a29094f4579.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Private Pool</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-703a04f1108111.svg"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Garden View</p></div></div></div><div class="collection-item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><div class="room-amenity-icon"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-3874f118411b98.png"/></div><div><p class="room-amenity-text">Extra Bed (+€80/n)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wrapper centered"><h2>The two pools are only a stroll away from each Suite</h2></div></div><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-64adee51fe70bc.avif" width="1440"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-b4b421ff01fe12.avif" width="1440"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-1da6e3b00d06a6.avif" width="1440"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-40cce6ea6da01e.avif" width="1440"/></div></div></div><div class="left-arrow w-slider-arrow-left"><img alt="arrow left" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-62e87937b486a8.svg"/></div><div class="right-arrow w-slider-arrow-right"><img alt="arrow right" class="slider-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-7d7a86fb467f08.svg"/></div><div class="slide-nav w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div></div></div>

